  message: "2026-10-27: both parts reproduced end to end, and production-path closure tests exist (PR #1905, merged 2fe7978820). packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/tests/test_axiom_falsification.py::TestCollapsedRowIsItsGroup. Part (2): recv and accept reaching subprocess through a helper collapse into one ddg_mixed row (collapsed_flow_count 2, source_primitives [accept, recv]); the choice_shaped_source caveat appears only when accept is called first. Part (1): process.env.TOKEN reaching a yours dom_injection sink (zlib.gzipSync, an enumerated module, so nothing else withholds) and document.write through one helper; document.write first -> inconclusive (INV-dudal withdraws), yours sink first -> confirmed_with_caveats, the false-clean direction. Both strict xfails, plus reach controls. Mutation: applying each fix shape (caveat over source_primitives; reached over the group's sink_primitives) flips its xfail to XPASS. Remove the marks in the fix PR."  # 6604
