  message: "Fixed in PR #1911 (802367974a). (1) _withhold_for_tainted_evaluation reads every member of a collapsed row's sink_primitives, mapped to the opaque-site spelling (_evaluation_site_spellings), not the witness sink. (2) the choice_shaped_source caveat tests source_primitives. Behavioural evidence: the production-path tests test_axiom_falsification.py::TestCollapsedRowIsItsGroup::test_the_evaluation_withdrawal_does_not_depend_on_the_witness (both member orders now inconclusive) and ::test_the_choice_caveat_does_not_depend_on_the_witness (same caveats in both orders) were strict xfails and now pass unmarked; core unit tests test_a_collapsed_row_is_withheld_for_any_member_of_its_group and test_a_group_whose_witness_is_not_choice_shaped_is_caveated. Each fix was mutated back to the witness read and its tests went red."  # 85ed
